    "zh": "本文件把三片区界面、D0 测量口径、逐门 RACI、单套设计测试数量、关键依赖、运营覆盖、验收、维护、备选与退出做成可复核的条件交付模型。它不是现场测绘、实际工程量清单、市场询价、预算、采购、人员承诺、专业签署、授权或运行结果。",
    "en": "This file makes the three-area interfaces, D0 measurement methods, gate-by-gate RACI, one-kit design-test quantities, critical dependencies, operating coverage, acceptance, maintenance, alternatives, and exit reviewable as a conditional delivery model. It is not a site survey, actual bill of quantities, market quotation, budget, procurement, staffing commitment, professional sign-off, authorization, or operating result.",
